<title>USA: Valeo to cut German plant, 234 jobs.</title>
<headline>Valeo to cut German plant, 234 jobs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valeo SA said Wednesday it will stop manufacturing certain products at its plant in Heiligenhaus, Germany, and cut 234 jobs.</p>
</text>
